      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly? I hope this kinda stays. Ive found that, with exceptions, Quest 2 can handle a lot higher quality avatars than it used to. Its biggest issues are still with the audio system lagging out in large groups.\n  \nMaybe check if Quest 1 and set to \"classic\" ranks if so?\n  \n(TBH Quest 2 should have its own separate rankings. Everyone I speak to agrees the rankings are still too aggressive on Q2 units, with no noticeable payoff in play.)",
